    ' returned in notes, and its answer read back. There is no Initialize on this interface: the members are set directly. exampleOrder puts them in the
    ' order of the API Help "Create Edge Flange" example (the radius first, the flange's own allowance fetched from the data with
    ' GetCustomBendAllowance); the other order is the builder's first one. count edges are in flangeEdges/flangeSketches (typed Object arrays: the API
    ' wants dispatch arrays). cornerGap >= 0 sets IEdgeFlangeFeatureData.GapDistance (several edges).
