7790         FlangeSizeSteps flangeData, angle, height, dimType, positionType, notes
7791         FlangeAllowanceSteps flangeData, kFactor, True, notes
7792         FlangeReliefSteps flangeData, reliefMode, reliefType, reliefWidth, reliefDepth, notes
    Else
7794         FlangeSizeSteps flangeData, angle, height, dimType, positionType, notes
7795         FlangeAllowanceSteps flangeData, kFactor, False, notes
7796         FlangeRadiusSteps flangeData, radius, notes
7797         FlangeReliefSteps flangeData, reliefMode, reliefType, reliefWidth, reliefDepth, notes
